                reserved: true,
                functions: [],
                note: "Supplies the RTC-domain pads (GPIO0, 2, 4, 12-15, 25-27, 32-39), the only GPIOs still controllable in Deep-sleep (other pads can at most hold a latched level), and feeds VDD_SDIO. 2.3-3.6 V; keep it above 3.0 V when VDD_SDIO powers 3.3 V flash/PSRAM. It cannot be powered alone: bring all supplies up together.",
