                note: "Strapping pin (MTDO), internal pull-up: LOW at reset silences the ROM\'s boot log on U0TXD (GPIO1); with GPIO5 it also sets the SDIO slave timing. JTAG TDO after reset. ADC2: unusable while Wi-Fi is on, and with esp-hal also while BLE runs. Erratum GPIO-3.14: once one pad in GPIO0-31 (or in GPIO32-39) has an edge interrupt, no other interrupt may be used in that group, as edges can be missed while the group\'s shared status register is accessed. The generated IRQ code always waits for edges and esp-hal has no workaround: arm at most one IRQ pad in GPIO0-27 and one in GPIO32-39.",
